| =C-c . C-r= | =ogent-zen-run-region=       | Ask about active region with Zen context |
| =C-c . C-e= | =ogent-zen-edit-dwim=        | Rewrite region/paragraph/sentence        |
| =C-c . C-a= | =ogent-zen-apply-last-edit=  | Re-preview latest structured edit        |
